    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ða hand lesan wille, ⁊ him mon ðæt geðafian wille, gelde swa to his were belimpe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to redeem the hand, and it is permitted him, let him pay in accordance with his wergild.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he wishes to redeem his hand, and if it is decided to give him permission to do so, he shall pay [such fine] as is appropiate to his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ða hond alysan wille, ond him mon þæt geðefyan wille, gylde swa to his were belimpe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
